{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34709","headline":"彼农二章 二 · 陆龟蒙","name":"彼农二章 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禹贡厥田，上下各异。\n善人爲邦，民受其赐。\n去年西成，野有遗穗。\n今夏南亩，旱气赤地。\n遭其丰凶，概歛无二。\n退输弗供，进诉弗视。\n号于旻天，以血爲泪。\n孟子有言，王无罪岁。\n诗以穷辞，以嫉悍吏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34709.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34709","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}